<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-pre-raid-opening" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic prior to Mogu'Shan Vaults opening and Celestial Dungeons becoming available. This list includes the 476 item level Epic weapon and neck from heroic dungeons that have a very low drop rate. Scroll down to the Heroic Dungeon List to view more alternatives.<br/>
<br/>
