<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="celestial-dungeon-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_legendarygem_05.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Celestial Dungeon Gear for Fury Warriors</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available from Celestial Dungeons in Phase 1 of Mists of Pandaria Classic. Keep in mind that these items are likely to be replaced by their Normal and Heroic raid counterparts. With that in mind, this is not a true "best in slot" list, and instead should serve as a rough guideline for what to keep an eye on from Celestial Dungeons.<br/>
