<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Fury Warriors</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to get powerful gear. This includes World Bosses such as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a> and <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=62346/galleon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Galleon</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>Sha of Anger is notable in that it drops item level 496 Tier 14 Legs and Gloves, as well as various item level 483 Malevolent Gladiator's pieces. This is a great way to get a headstart on your Tier set if you get lucky. <br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90912/angerforged-stompers">
<img alt="Angerforged Stompers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Angerforged Stompers</span></a>, a decent pair of early Boots.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleon">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon</span></h3>Galleon is another notable world boss available during Phase 1. He drops plenty of great 496 item level pieces, any of which are likely to be an upgrade if you haven't yet stepped foot in a raid. <br/>
<br/>Galleon drops the following relevant items for Warriors:<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90433/mushan-riders-collar">
<img alt="Mushan Rider's Collar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_100.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mushan Rider's Collar</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90438/signet-of-the-bandit-lord">
<img alt="Signet of the Bandit Lord" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicring_b2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Bandit Lord</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90447/stompers-of-vigorous-stomping">
<img alt="Stompers of Vigorous Stomping" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_raiddeathknight_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stompers of Vigorous Stomping</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90414/greathelm-of-the-monstrous-mushan">
<img alt="Greathelm of the Monstrous Mushan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greathelm of the Monstrous Mushan</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90456/cord-of-crazed-strength">
<img alt="Cord of Crazed Strength" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of Crazed Strength</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90425/carapace-of-crushed-conviction">
<img alt="Carapace of Crushed Conviction" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Carapace of Crushed Conviction</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="rare-mobs">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> World Drops</span></h3>Like most previous expansions, there are various powerful epic-level world drops that have a chance to drop from high-level mobs. In Mists of Pandaria, these items are 476 item level.<br/>
<br/>The notable ones for Warriors are:<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90580/cristofs-crushing-cloak">
<img alt="Cristof's Crushing Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cristof's Crushing Cloak</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90579/legplates-of-durable-dreams">
<img alt="Legplates of Durable Dreams" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legplates of Durable Dreams</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90581/jan-hos-unwavering-seal">
<img alt="Jan-Ho's Unwavering Seal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicring_b1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jan-Ho's Unwavering Seal</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90582/buc-zakai-memento">
<img alt="Buc-Zakai Memento" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_109.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Buc-Zakai Memento</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Reputation for Fury Warriors in Phase 1</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. The two best options to start with are <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1269/golden-lotus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Lotus</span></a> or <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1337/the-klaxxi">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Klaxxi</span></a>, as they both offer a 489 item level epic at Exalted through a quest. Out of these two options, I would recommend starting with The Golden Lotus, as it unlocks the two Valor pieces <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89345/stonetoe-spaulders">
<img alt="Stonetoe Spaulders" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stonetoe Spaulders</span></a> &amp; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89069/ring-of-the-golden-stair">
<img alt="Ring of the Golden Stair" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_147.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Golden Stair</span></a>, which are your pre-Mogu'Shan vault BiS list.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="golden-lotus">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
